    "custom_html_NUqWFg": {
      "type": "custom-html",
      "settings": {
        "custom_html": "<section class=\"about-fireside\">\n  <h2>About Fireside Hearth & Home in Maple Grove</h2>\n  <p>Located at <span class=\"location\">7937 Wedgewood Ln N, Maple Grove, MN 55369</span>, Fireside Hearth & Home is one of the largest and most trusted fireplace retailers in the Twin Cities metro area. Our showroom showcases an impressive selection of fireplaces, including gas, wood, and electric fireplaces, as well as wood-burning stoves and inserts. We also offer a variety of outdoor products, such as grills, fire pits, and outdoor fireplaces, perfect for enhancing your outdoor living spaces.</p>\n  <p>At Fireside, we feature popular brands including <span class=\"brand\">Heat & Glo, Heatilator, Quadra-Fire, Harman, and Majestic</span>, ensuring top-tier quality and performance for every product we sell. Our knowledgeable Hearth Experts are committed to making your selection process easy, informative, and enjoyable.</p>\n\n  <h3>Fireplace Store Near Me</h3>\n  <p>If you're searching for a \"<span class=\"search-term\">fireplace store near me</span>\" in Maple Grove, Fireside Hearth & Home is your go-to destination. Our showroom offers a wide range of fireplaces to match various styles and budgets. Whether you prefer the timeless charm of a wood-burning fireplace or the modern convenience of an electric model, we have the perfect solution to meet your needs.</p>\n  <p>Our expert team is here to assist with selecting, customizing, and professionally installing your ideal fireplace, creating a warm and inviting atmosphere for your home.</p>\n\n  <h3>Frequently Asked Questions</h3>\n  <ol class=\"faq\">\n    <li>\n      <strong>What types of fireplaces do you offer?</strong>\n      <p>We offer a full range of fireplaces, including gas, wood, and electric models, along with stoves and inserts. Each type has unique benefits, and our Hearth Experts can help you choose the best fit for your home and lifestyle.</p>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n      <strong>Do you provide installation services?</strong>\n      <p>Yes! Our professional installation services ensure your fireplace is installed safely and operates efficiently. From venting requirements to setup, our technicians handle everything.</p>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n      <strong>How often should I have my fireplace serviced?</strong>\n      <p>For safety and efficiency, annual maintenance is recommended. Our service team is equipped to handle inspections, cleanings, and repairs for all types of fireplaces.</p>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n      <strong>Can I convert my wood-burning fireplace to gas or electric?</strong>\n      <p>Absolutely. We offer conversion services to transform your wood-burning fireplace into a gas or electric unit, offering enhanced convenience and efficiency.</p>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n      <strong>Do you offer financing options?</strong>\n      <p>Yes, we provide financing options to make your fireplace purchase more accessible. Our team can guide you through available plans to fit your budget.</p>\n    </li>\n  </ol>\n\n  <h4>Why Choose Fireside Hearth & Home in Maple Grove?</h4>\n  <ul class=\"benefits\">\n    <li>\n<strong>Top Brands:</strong> Explore our range of premium fireplaces from Heat & Glo, Heatilator, Quadra-Fire, Harman, and Majestic.</li>\n    <li>\n<strong>Expert Guidance:</strong> Our Hearth Experts assist in every step, from selection to installation.</li>\n    <li>\n<strong>Comprehensive Services:</strong> We offer professional installation, maintenance, and repair services to keep your fireplace running efficiently.</li>\n    <li>\n<strong>Energy-Efficient Options:</strong> Many of our fireplaces are designed with energy-saving features, helping you stay warm while lowering utility costs.</li>\n    <li>\n<strong>Outdoor Solutions:</strong> Discover grills, fire pits, and outdoor fireplaces to elevate your outdoor living spaces.</li>\n  </ul>\n</section>",
        "no-top-padding": false,
        "show-wood-bg": false,
        "css_class": "",
        "custom_css": ""
      }
    },
